---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout>
  <header>
    <div class="container header-inner">
      <a href="/" class="logo">
        <img src="/logo.jpg" alt="Central PA Mesh Logo - Meshcore and LoRa network in Pennsylvania" />
        <div class="logo-text">
          CENTRAL PA<br>
          <span>MESH</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <nav>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#get-started">Get Started</a>
        <a href="#resources">Resources</a>
        <a href="https://discord.gg/9wWs3Y7Cx5" class="icon-btn discord-btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Join Discord">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="currentColor"><path d="M20.317 4.37a19.791 19.791 0 0 0-4.885-1.515.074.074 0 0 0-.079.037c-.21.375-.444.864-.608 1.25a18.27 18.27 0 0 0-5.487 0 12.64 12.64 0 0 0-.617-1.25.077.077 0 0 0-.079-.037A19.736 19.736 0 0 0 3.677 4.37a.07.07 0 0 0-.032.027C.533 9.046-.32 13.58.099 18.057a.082.082 0 0 0 .031.057 19.9 19.9 0 0 0 5.993 3.03.078.078 0 0 0 .084-.028 14.09 14.09 0 0 0 1.226-1.994.076.076 0 0 0-.041-.106 13.107 13.107 0 0 1-1.872-.892.077.077 0 0 1-.008-.128 10.2 10.2 0 0 0 .372-.292.074.074 0 0 1 .077-.01c3.928 1.793 8.18 1.793 12.062 0a.074.074 0 0 1 .078.01c.12.098.246.198.373.292a.077.077 0 0 1-.006.127 12.299 12.299 0 0 1-1.873.892.077.077 0 0 0-.041.107c.36.698.772 1.362 1.225 1.993a.076.076 0 0 0 .084.028 19.839 19.839 0 0 0 6.002-3.03.077.077 0 0 0 .032-.054c.5-5.177-.838-9.674-3.549-13.66a.061.061 0 0 0-.031-.03zM8.02 15.33c-1.183 0-2.157-1.085-2.157-2.419 0-1.333.956-2.419 2.157-2.419 1.21 0 2.176 1.096 2.157 2.42 0 1.333-.956 2.418-2.157 2.418zm7.975 0c-1.183 0-2.157-1.085-2.157-2.419 0-1.333.955-2.419 2.157-2.419 1.21 0 2.176 1.096 2.157 2.42 0 1.333-.946 2.418-2.157 2.418z"/></svg>
          Discord
        </a>
        <a href="https://www.facebook.com/share/g/1E1nHxfQyd/" class="icon-btn facebook-btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Join Facebook">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="currentColor"><path d="M24 12.073c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12s-12 5.373-12 12c0 5.99 4.388 10.954 10.125 11.854v-8.385H7.078v-3.47h3.047V9.43c0-3.007 1.792-4.669 4.533-4.669 1.312 0 2.686.235 2.686.235v2.953H15.83c-1.491 0-1.956.925-1.956 1.874v2.25h3.328l-.532 3.47h-2.796v8.385C19.612 23.027 24 18.062 24 12.073z"/></svg>
          Facebook
        </a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <img class="hero-banner" src="/logo.jpg" alt="Central PA Mesh - Decentralized Communities" />
    <div class="container">
      <p>
        The largest Meshcore community in Central Pennsylvania, with Meshtastic users welcome. 
        Off-grid LoRa mesh networking for Centre, Clinton, Clearfield, Cambria, Blair, and northern Huntingdon Counties as well as the surrounding region. With 28 Meshcore repeaters serving the area and regularly expanding coverage.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-group">
        <a href="https://discord.gg/9wWs3Y7Cx5" class="icon-btn discord-btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor"><path d="M20.317 4.37a19.791 19.791 0 0 0-4.885-1.515.074.074 0 0 0-.079.037c-.21.375-.444.864-.608 1.25a18.27 18.27 0 0 0-5.487 0 12.64 12.64 0 0 0-.617-1.25.077.077 0 0 0-.079-.037A19.736 19.736 0 0 0 3.677 4.37a.07.07 0 0 0-.032.027C.533 9.046-.32 13.58.099 18.057a.082.082 0 0 0 .031.057 19.9 19.9 0 0 0 5.993 3.03.078.078 0 0 0 .084-.028 14.09 14.09 0 0 0 1.226-1.994.076.076 0 0 0-.041-.106 13.107 13.107 0 0 1-1.872-.892.077.077 0 0 1-.008-.128 10.2 10.2 0 0 0 .372-.292.074.074 0 0 1 .077-.01c3.928 1.793 8.18 1.793 12.062 0a.074.074 0 0 1 .078.01c.12.098.246.198.373.292a.077.077 0 0 1-.006.127 12.299 12.299 0 0 1-1.873.892.077.077 0 0 0-.041.107c.36.698.772 1.362 1.225 1.993a.076.076 0 0 0 .084.028 19.839 19.839 0 0 0 6.002-3.03.077.077 0 0 0 .032-.054c.5-5.177-.838-9.674-3.549-13.66a.061.061 0 0 0-.031-.03zM8.02 15.33c-1.183 0-2.157-1.085-2.157-2.419 0-1.333.956-2.419 2.157-2.419 1.21 0 2.176 1.096 2.157 2.42 0 1.333-.956 2.418-2.157 2.418zm7.975 0c-1.183 0-2.157-1.085-2.157-2.419 0-1.333.955-2.419 2.157-2.419 1.21 0 2.176 1.096 2.157 2.42 0 1.333-.946 2.418-2.157 2.418z"/></svg>
          Join Discord
        </a>
        <a href="https://www.facebook.com/share/g/1E1nHxfQyd/" class="icon-btn facebook-btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor"><path d="M24 12.073c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12s-12 5.373-12 12c0 5.99 4.388 10.954 10.125 11.854v-8.385H7.078v-3.47h3.047V9.43c0-3.007 1.792-4.669 4.533-4.669 1.312 0 2.686.235 2.686.235v2.953H15.83c-1.491 0-1.956.925-1.956 1.874v2.25h3.328l-.532 3.47h-2.796v8.385C19.612 23.027 24 18.062 24 12.073z"/></svg>
          Join Facebook
        </a>
        <a href="#get-started" class="btn-secondary">How to Connect</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="about">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>About Central PA Mesh</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">
        Central PA Mesh brings together Meshcore and Meshtastic to build a reliable, community-owned LoRa radio network across Central Pennsylvania. No cell towers or internet required, and primarily solar powered messaging.
      </p>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Meshcore First</h3>
          <p>We primarily use Meshcore for lightweight, multi-hop LoRa messaging. It's simple, scalable, and designed for real-world off-grid use across Central PA.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Meshtastic Welcome</h3>
          <p>Meshtastic users are part of the broader community. We're happy to help bridge networks and share knowledge across both Meshcore and Meshtastic in Pennsylvania.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Local & Decentralized</h3>
          <p>No central servers. Messages hop from node to node across the region and beyond. The more nodes, the stronger the mesh.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="discord-highlight" id="discord">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Find Us on Discord</h2>
      <p>
        The best way to get help, share node locations, coordinate builds, and stay updated is our Discord server. 
        New Meshcore and Meshtastic users in Central PA are always welcome.
      </p>
      <div class="discord-widget-wrap">
        <iframe 
          src="https://discord.com/widget?id=1454268403958419571&theme=dark" 
          class="discord-widget"
          allowtransparency="true" 
          frameborder="0" 
          sandbox="allow-popups allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox allow-same-origin allow-scripts">
        </iframe>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="map">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Coverage Map</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">
        Live MeshMapper repeaters for the Central PA (SCE) region. Click the map to open the full interactive view.
      </p>

      <h3 style="text-align:center; margin: 2rem 0 1rem; font-size:1.4rem;">Full MeshMapper View</h3>

      <!-- Desktop -->
      <a href="https://sce.meshmapper.net/?iata=SCE&preset=all&m=std&l=rep.rcov.nbr.nz.nzb.rb&cm=std&lat=40.58307&lon=-77.75931&zoom=8.00" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="map-desktop" style="display:block; width:100%; height:520px; border-radius:12px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.08);">
        <iframe
          src="https://sce.meshmapper.net/?iata=SCE&preset=all&m=std&l=rep.rcov.nbr.nz.nzb.rb&cm=std&lat=40.58307&lon=-77.75931&zoom=8.00"
          style="width:100%; height:100%; border:none; pointer-events:none;"
          loading="lazy"
          title="MeshMapper SCE">
        </iframe>
      </a>

      <!-- Mobile -->
      <a href="https://sce.meshmapper.net/?iata=SCE&preset=all&m=std&l=rep.rcov.nbr.nz.nzb.rb&cm=std&lat=40.58307&lon=-77.75931&zoom=7.44" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="map-mobile" style="display:none; width:100%; height:380px; border-radius:12px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.08);">
        <iframe
          src="https://sce.meshmapper.net/?iata=SCE&preset=all&m=std&l=rep.rcov.nbr.nz.nzb.rb&cm=std&lat=40.58307&lon=-77.75931&zoom=7.44"
          style="width:100%; height:100%; border:none; pointer-events:none;"
          loading="lazy"
          title="MeshMapper SCE">
        </iframe>
      </a>

      <h3 style="text-align:center; margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem; font-size:1.4rem;">Meshcore Open Map</h3>

      <a href="https://map.meshcoreopen.org/#map=7.28/40.3225/-78.4801&layers=repeaters,links,coverage&window=7d&repeater=dc09916e197a144614a856d8aa807c8f2ea92b34c87b1020d84e7aabb75d6260" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="map-desktop" style="display:block; width:100%; height:520px; border-radius:12px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.08);">
        <iframe
          src="https://map.meshcoreopen.org/#map=7.28/40.3225/-78.4801&layers=repeaters,links,coverage&window=7d&repeater=dc09916e197a144614a856d8aa807c8f2ea92b34c87b1020d84e7aabb75d6260"
          style="width:100%; height:100%; border:none; pointer-events:none;"
          loading="lazy"
          title="Meshcore Open Map">
        </iframe>
      </a>

      <a href="https://map.meshcoreopen.org/#map=7.28/40.3225/-78.4801&layers=repeaters,links,coverage&window=7d&repeater=dc09916e197a144614a856d8aa807c8f2ea92b34c87b1020d84e7aabb75d6260" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="map-mobile" style="display:none; width:100%; height:380px; border-radius:12px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.08);">
        <iframe
          src="https://map.meshcoreopen.org/#map=7.28/40.3225/-78.4801&layers=repeaters,links,coverage&window=7d&repeater=dc09916e197a144614a856d8aa807c8f2ea92b34c87b1020d84e7aabb75d6260"
          style="width:100%; height:100%; border:none; pointer-events:none;"
          loading="lazy"
          title="Meshcore Open Map">
        </iframe>
      </a>

      <p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 1rem;">
        <a href="https://sce.meshmapper.net/?iata=SCE&preset=all&m=std&l=rep.rcov.nbr.nz.nzb.rb&cm=std&lat=40.58307&lon=-77.75931&zoom=8.00" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open full map on MeshMapper →</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      .map-desktop { display: none !important; }
      .map-mobile { display: block !important; }
    }
  </style>

  <section id="get-started">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>How to Get Started with LoRa Mesh in Central PA</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">
        Getting on the Central PA Mesh is straightforward. Here's a basic path for most people to get started.
      </p>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>1. Get Hardware</h3>
          <p>A LoRa radio (Heltec, RAK, LilyGo, etc.) that supports Meshcore. Make sure it's the 915 MHz version for the US and Central Pennsylvania.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>2. Flash Firmware</h3>
          <p>Use the official Meshcore web flasher or community tools. Most devices can be flashed in under a minute.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>3. Join the Network</h3>
          <p>Set the USA/Canada regional preset, power on, and start talking. Then hop into Discord to introduce yourself and find nearby nodes in Central PA.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Host a Repeater</h3>
          <p>
            No coverage near you, or want to host a repeater? Get in touch and we’ll help you get on the mesh.
          </p>
          <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">
            <a href="mailto:Centralpamesh@gmail.com" class="btn-secondary">Contact Us</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="resources">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Resources for Meshcore & Meshtastic in Pennsylvania</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">
        Official and community links to help you get online and stay connected on the Central PA Mesh.
      </p>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Official Meshcore</h3>
          <p>
            <a href="https://meshcore.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener">meshcore.io</a> · 
            <a href="https://flasher.meshcore.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener">flasher.meshcore.io</a> · 
            <a href="https://map.meshcore.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener">map.meshcore.io</a>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Getting Started</h3>
          <p>
            <a href="https://www.MeshcoreLearning.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">www.MeshcoreLearning.org</a> — A fantastic resource covering the basics of Meshcore and beyond.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Local Help</h3>
          <p>Ask in Discord for recommended frequencies, known repeaters, and people near you!</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <div class="container">
      <img src="/logo.jpg" alt="Central PA Mesh" class="footer-logo" />
      <p>
        Central PA Mesh · CPAMe.sh<br>
        Decentralized Communities · LoRa Mesh Networking in Central Pennsylvania
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">
        <a href="https://discord.gg/9wWs3Y7Cx5" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Discord</a>
        · 
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        · 
        <a href="#resources">Resources</a>
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top: 2rem; font-size: 0.85rem;">
        Community site for the Central PA Mesh network (Meshcore & Meshtastic). Not affiliated with official Meshcore or Meshtastic projects.
      </p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Layout>
